     "text": "In the present age, in almost all countries paper money has come to be used, which consists of notes issued by the government or the central bank. These notes cannot be converted into gold or silver, i.e. the government has declared them inconvertible paper money. Yet these notes are performing the work of money in the best way, because people accept them without hesitation. Paper money has these benefits.",
