     "urdu": "\"Even if the absolute efficiencies in two places were identical, trade might occur beacuse of differeces in tastes.\" (P.A.S.)",
     "pashto": "\"Even if the absolute efficiencies in two places were identical, trade might occur beacuse of differeces in tastes.\" (P.A.S.)",
     "untranslatedByDesign": true
