   "content": "<p>9. How many stock exchanges are working in Pakistan?</p><p>A. In Pakistan the following stock exchanges are working: (i) Karachi Stock Exchange; (ii) Islamabad Stock Exchange; (iii) Lahore Stock Exchange.</p><p>10. What is the rate of growth of Pakistan’s economy?</p><p>A. The rate of growth of Pakistan’s economy is 5.79%.</p><p>11. What is the share of industries in gross national product?</p><p>A. 21.02%.</p><p>12. What is the share of agriculture in gross national product?</p><p>A. 18.9%.</p><p>13. What is the share of services in gross national product?</p><p>A. 60.23%.</p><p>14. What is the literacy rate of Pakistan?</p><p>A. The literacy rate of Pakistan is 58%.</p><p>15. What is the population of Pakistan?</p><p>A. The population of Pakistan is 207.7 million, while its rate of growth is 2.4%.</p><p>16. What is the per capita income in Pakistan?</p><p>A. The per capita income of Pakistan is 1641 dollars.</p><p>17. What is the rate of growth of the agricultural sector?</p><p>A. 3.81%.</p><p>2. Of the four possible answers of the following questions, choose the correct answer and put the mark (✓).</p><p>1. The share of the agricultural sector in Pakistan’s GDP is so much:</p><p>(a) 42 per cent  (b) 18.9 per cent ✓</p><p>(c) 34 per cent  (d) 19 per cent</p><p>2. This per cent of Pakistan’s manpower is associated with agriculture:</p><p>(a) 47 per cent  (b) 57 per cent</p><p>(c) 42.3 per cent ✓  (d) 77 per cent</p><p>3. The biggest problem of the agricultural sector is:</p><p>(a) low productivity ✓  (b) shortage of credit</p><p>(c) defective system of land ownership  (d) shortage of fertiliser</p><p>4. The share of the industrial sector in GDP is this much:</p><p>(a) 15 per cent  (b) 20.87 per cent ✓</p><p>(c) 21 per cent  (d) 25 per cent</p><p>5. The share of manufactures in Pakistan’s exports is this much:</p><p>(a) 48 per cent  (b) 58 per cent</p><p>(c) 68 per cent  (d) … per cent ✓</p>",
