     "text": "Through banks the financial resources of the country (i.e. savings and capital) are distributed into such sectors, businesses and industries where they can prove most useful and productive, because the countless people of the country who save money do not themselves know its most correct use; but through banks this money of theirs gets put into suitable works.",
