     "text": "Zakat is an important obligation among the basic obligations of Islam, and it is the financial worship of Muslims. Without the observance of this obligation they cannot pay the full right of their servitude and faith. Therefore, although it is paid purely for the pleasure and seeking the approval of Allah Most High, its blessings appear in our worldly life too, and through it many economic and social benefits are obtained, which are mentioned below. By virtue of these benefits social justice (Social Justice) is established in society, and every person, in an economically and socially balanced way, obtains the resources of a pleasant, comfortable life, and society sets out on the path of progress, prosperity and mutual cooperation.",
